{"beat": 13, "name": "THE PLANT", "text": "On January 22, 1906, Sears moved into a new plant on Chicago's West Side, years before anyone mailed a parcel at a parcel rate. The merchandise building alone covered 3 million square feet. Railroad tracks ran into it. It had its own post office branch inside. And it ran on a schedule, designed by the operations superintendent, Otto Doering. Every order that came in was assigned a shipping room and a fifteen-minute window. Every department that held an item on that order had to deliver it to that room, in that window. If a department was late, the item shipped separately, and the department was billed for the extra cost.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "On", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.18}, {"word": "January", "start": 0.18, "end": 0.56}, {"word": "22,", "start": 0.56, "end": 1.22}, {"word": "1906,", "start": 1.74, "end": 2.74}, {"word": "Sears", "start": 3.44, "end": 3.74}, {"word": "moved", "start": 3.74, "end": 4.04}, {"word": "into", "start": 4.04, "end": 4.32}, {"word": "a", "start": 4.32, "end": 4.48}, {"word": "new", "start": 4.48, "end": 4.68}, {"word": "plant", "start": 4.68, "end": 5.08}, {"word": "on", "start": 5.08, "end": 5.28}, {"word": "Chicago's", "start": 5.28, "end": 6.0}, {"word": "West", "start": 6.0, "end": 6.22}, {"word": "Side,", "start": 6.22, "end": 6.74}, {"word": "years", "start": 7.18, "end": 7.56}, {"word": "before", "start": 7.56, "end": 7.9}, {"word": "anyone", "start": 7.9, "end": 8.46}, {"word": "mailed", "start": 8.46, "end": 8.84}, {"word": "a", "start": 8.84, "end": 8.98}, {"word": "parcel", "start": 8.98, "end": 9.4}, {"word": "at", "start": 9.4, "end": 9.62}, {"word": "a", "start": 9.62, "end": 9.76}, {"word": "parcel", "start": 9.76, "end": 10.1}, {"word": "rate.", "start": 10.1, "end": 10.44}, {"word": "The", "start": 11.1, "end": 11.24}, {"word": "merchandise", "start": 11.24, "end": 11.6}, {"word": "building", "start": 11.6, "end": 12.26}, {"word": "alone", "start": 12.26